00:28:40.120 --> 00:28:44.960
There was like the great awakening of like, wait a minute, the A button was designed for

00:28:44.960 --> 00:28:53.980
track and field. I just, I like to think of the sports game genre just like trying to find its way in

00:28:54.720 --> 00:28:59.320
like this early section of gaming history of just like, we should just do all the sports

00:28:59.320 --> 00:29:01.500
and they'll just figure it out.

00:29:01.680 --> 00:29:03.180
Like, running.

00:29:03.180 --> 00:29:06.360
