00:35:15.140 --> 00:35:16.960
Just hitting a button a bunch of times.

00:35:16.960 --> 00:35:21.520
Like, it literally is the, the most basic way to interact with software.

00:35:22.060 --> 00:35:25.960
Um, but, I mean, it's, it's got a fun presentation.

00:35:25.960 --> 00:35:34.180
Um, there are some modes that require a more intricate plan of attack than just the first one.

00:35:34.340 --> 00:35:41.120
