00:35:41.300 --> 00:35:42.260
But it never gets...

00:35:42.260 --> 00:35:43.320
The most basic level.

00:35:43.320 --> 00:35:47.100
Yeah, it never gets too much more complex.

00:35:47.560 --> 00:35:53.020
It's just a timing game and a, uh, endurance of your arm game.

00:35:53.020 --> 00:35:58.080
Um, so, it's a neat little curio.

00:35:58.440 --> 00:36:00.120
Even though I guess they're very common.

